<% content_for :page_title, @locale == "en" ? "Unsubscribed — Vittio" : "Suscripción cancelada — Vittio" %>

<%= render "shared/marketing_header" %>

<main>
  <div class="container blog-article-container">
    <header class="blog-article-head">
      <h1 class="blog-article-title" data-lang-es>Listo</h1>
      <h1 class="blog-article-title" data-lang-en data-lang-en-block>Done</h1>
    </header>

    <article class="blog-prose">
      <p data-lang-es>
        Ya no enviaremos avisos sobre el fin de tu prueba a
        <strong><%= @user.email %></strong>.
      </p>
      <p data-lang-en data-lang-en-block>
        We'll no longer send trial-ending notices to
        <strong><%= @user.email %></strong>.
      </p>

      <%# The "write to support" line below is a stopgap: there is no Settings toggle for
          notify_trial_reminders yet on web or mobile. When one ships (Phase 23's preference
          matrix, or sooner), replace this with a pointer to Settings in BOTH languages —
          telling someone to email support when a switch exists is the worse answer. %>
      <p data-lang-es>
        Seguirás recibiendo correos indispensables de tu cuenta, como confirmación
        de correo y restablecimiento de contraseña. Si más adelante quieres volver a
        recibir estos avisos, escríbenos a
        <a href="mailto:<%= support_email %>"><%= support_email %></a>.
      </p>
      <p data-lang-en data-lang-en-block>
        You'll still get essential account email, such as address confirmation and
        password resets. If you'd like these notices back later, write to
        <a href="mailto:<%= support_email %>"><%= support_email %></a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</main>
